{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01773",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 6.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.35,
      "end_seconds": 15.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.66,
      "end_seconds": 30.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.15,
      "text": "Actually, it's being confused and drowsy. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.59,
      "end_seconds": 34.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.89,
      "end_seconds": 38.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Ever since... since last weekend, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.64,
      "end_seconds": 43.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.43,
      "end_seconds": 46.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.89,
      "end_seconds": 49.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.2,
      "end_seconds": 63.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get being extremely thirsty as well. Erm, I've also been passing huge amounts of urine, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.92,
      "end_seconds": 67.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Alright, how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.42,
      "end_seconds": 76.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. The being extremely thirsty? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.56,
      "end_seconds": 80.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.48,
      "end_seconds": 85.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I, I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.51,
      "end_seconds": 95.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, vomiting or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.82,
      "end_seconds": 101.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Okay, so no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.2,
      "end_seconds": 109.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.42,
      "end_seconds": 118.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "So, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.81,
      "end_seconds": 123.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.26,
      "end_seconds": 130.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Yeah, um, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.17,
      "end_seconds": 135.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right, did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.16,
      "end_seconds": 141.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Uh, I had a triple bypass eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 152.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.7,
      "end_seconds": 167.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "I'm on Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. Metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.13,
      "end_seconds": 171.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.29,
      "end_seconds": 173.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "About two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.18,
      "end_seconds": 184.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.59,
      "end_seconds": 188.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.64,
      "end_seconds": 193.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.16,
      "end_seconds": 198.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.7,
      "end_seconds": 208.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.84,
      "end_seconds": 225.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.05,
      "end_seconds": 234.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.99,
      "end_seconds": 236.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.21,
      "end_seconds": 239.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.74,
      "end_seconds": 242.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 255.08,
      "end_seconds": 267.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature 36.8, BP is 125 over 83, BMI works out to 29.6, pulse is 113 beats a minute, weight 72 kilos, height 156 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.15,
      "end_seconds": 269.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.01,
      "end_seconds": 275.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.86,
      "end_seconds": 288.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.41,
      "end_seconds": 291.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "So, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.39,
      "end_seconds": 310.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "You are very dry and drowsy, and your sugar reading is too high to read."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.63,
      "end_seconds": 324.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is a hyperosmolar diabetic emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 326.35,
      "end_seconds": 329.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "We've already done an ECG this morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.72,
      "end_seconds": 354.03,
      "duration_seconds": 23.31,
      "text": "Thanks, I'll have a look. I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for hyperglycaemic emergency. You need hospital now for fluids and insulin. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Please come and see me straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.22,
      "end_seconds": 358.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.54,
      "end_seconds": 364.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}